	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Postquam priores occlusi, venit <persName ref="p4191">Apiarius</persName> et indicat mihi, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quid a senatu decretum.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Res aliter fuit proposita, quam ego <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>putassem; tui enim et tui operis mentio facta est.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Vult <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>senatus, ut a scholarchis prius illud inspiciatur, et quamvis <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>in id, ut imprimatur, admodum sint propensi, verentur <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>tamen, ne quid inde turbarum ab adversaria parte oriatur, propterea quod mysteriu<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>m iniquitatis ibi sine dubio cum <placeName ref="l425">Romano</placeName> idolo... explicetur<note type="misc">Am Rand: propterea- explicetur</note>.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Lectae sunt coram senatu <persName ref="p1227">Froschoveri</persName> literae, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quae (quoniam admodum hoc urget, ut urbis <placeName ref="l41">Bernensis</placeName> nomen addatur idque cum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>consensu magistratus) suspicionem iniecere multis <persName ref="p1227">Fro<lb xml:id="p1z10"/>schoverum</persName> quaerere, ut ipse se et <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinos</placeName> eximat, nostros <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>vero involvat liti, quę inde oriri poterat.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Et siquidem <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hoc sit, mallem ego mihi nihil esse cum hoc negotii, ne in <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>me tandem tanquam conscio, et qui non praemonuerim, haec faba <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>cudatur.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Rogo ergo, ut tu ipse, quid faciendum sit, consul[as]<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="de">Ists neißwas also, so ists wäger underlon; man meint so[nst], <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>man welle allen unlust gern uff min herren laden.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="de">S[onst] <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>üwerthalb fröwte es min herren wol, und hettinds für ein groß <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ehr, so ir üwre werck hie ließind ußgon.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Haec prioribus <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>addere volui, ut scias, quid sit actum.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale iterum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Datę ut priores.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">Cupimus tamen omnino nos inspicere lucubration<lb xml:id="p1z21"/>es has tuas et iis ad utilitatem nostram fr<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>ui.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z2"/>Clairissimo viro d. <lb xml:id="p2z3"/><persName ref="p495">Heinrycho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>domino et com<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>patri colendissimo <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>et charissimo suo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Darunter von <persName ref="p495">Bullingers</persName> Hand:]</note>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">10<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>. octobris 15<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>56.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note>[Zudem von ihm auf der Adresse vermerkt:]</note>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="de">Der Apocalypsis zuͦ <placeName ref="l41">Bern</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>ze trucken.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
